      "texts": [
        {
          "shape_id": 3,
          "paragraph": 0,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "01  体检合格的错觉：我身上5个看似无法解释的矛盾现象",
          "left": 731520,
          "top": 457200,
          "width": 10728655,
          "height": 731520,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 4,
          "paragraph": 1,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "1. 血糖两极分化：空腹血糖数据表现优异，但餐后极易飙升，运动后又剧烈下探发生虚弱。",
          "left": 731520,
          "top": 1463040,
          "width": 10728655,
          "height": 4572000,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 4,
          "paragraph": 2,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "2. 关机却不充电：倒头就睡、从不起夜，但次日清晨极度疲惫，像电量永远卡在 30% 。",
          "left": 731520,
          "top": 1463040,
          "width": 10728655,
          "height": 4572000,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 4,
          "paragraph": 3,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "3. 终身不酒的高尿酸：对酒精极度敏感、一辈子几乎不饮酒，但长期高尿酸，需药物压制。",
          "left": 731520,
          "top": 1463040,
          "width": 10728655,
          "height": 4572000,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 4,
          "paragraph": 4,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "4. 结构性关节痛与脑雾：无重体力劳动，但髋部与肩关节长期疼痛；下午脑雾明显，效率下降。",
          "left": 731520,
          "top": 1463040,
          "width": 10728655,
          "height": 4572000,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 4,
          "paragraph": 5,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "5. 胃黏膜糜烂与息肉切除：六癌甲基化早筛阴性，但胃窦慢性炎、乙状结肠管状腺瘤异型增生。",
          "left": 731520,
          "top": 1463040,
          "width": 10728655,
          "height": 4572000,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        }
      ],
