      "texts": [
        {
          "shape_id": 3,
          "paragraph": 0,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "01  回归医学共识：梅奥诊所的整合定义与功能医学根源",
          "left": 731520,
          "top": 457200,
          "width": 10728655,
          "height": 731520,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 4,
          "paragraph": 0,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "• 梅奥诊所 (Mayo Clinic) 对整合医学的训诫：",
          "left": 914400,
          "top": 2011680,
          "width": 10362895,
          "height": 4114800,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 4,
          "paragraph": 1,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "   绝非抛弃常规医疗，而是在常规基础上结合营养、运动、压力管理等手段，团队化解决疲劳、疼痛与慢病。",
          "left": 914400,
          "top": 2011680,
          "width": 10362895,
          "height": 4114800,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 4,
          "paragraph": 2,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "• 功能医学的核心公理：",
          "left": 914400,
          "top": 2011680,
          "width": 10362895,
          "height": 4114800,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 4,
          "paragraph": 3,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "   身体绝非孤立零件的机械拼凑，而是一张复杂的化学网络。任何单点器官的异动，都是底层系统失衡的表现。",
          "left": 914400,
          "top": 2011680,
          "width": 10362895,
          "height": 4114800,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        }
      ],
