          "top": 1463040,
          "width": 6705295,
          "height": 4572000,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 6,
          "paragraph": 2,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "• 实事求是的严谨审视：2025年系统综述提示，FMT 用于肥胖与代谢仍在快速发展的探索期；2023年荟萃分析证实其能短期改善胰岛素敏感性与 HDL，必须审慎客观看待。",
          "left": 4754880,
          "top": 1463040,
          "width": 6705295,
          "height": 4572000,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 6,
          "paragraph": 3,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "• 四维轴向联动闭环目标：",
          "left": 4754880,
          "top": 1463040,
          "width": 6705295,
          "height": 4572000,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 6,
          "paragraph": 4,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "  - [肠-脑轴] 狙击并逆转脑雾与认知衰退  |  - [肠-代谢轴] 稳固并削减餐后血糖波动",
          "left": 4754880,
          "top": 1463040,
          "width": 6705295,
          "height": 4572000,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 6,
          "paragraph": 5,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "  - [肠-免疫轴] 彻底熄灭系统性低度微炎症  |  - [肠-肾轴] 协同辅助尿酸排泄与压力泄洪",
          "left": 4754880,
          "top": 1463040,
          "width": 6705295,
          "height": 4572000,
