      "texts": [
        {
          "shape_id": 3,
          "paragraph": 0,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "03  干预三：多肽、外源性 NAD+ 的线粒体锚定，而非抗衰神针",
          "left": 731520,
          "top": 457200,
          "width": 10728655,
          "height": 731520,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 4,
          "paragraph": 1,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "• 生物化学定位：",
          "left": 914400,
          "top": 1828800,
          "width": 10362895,
          "height": 4389120,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 4,
          "paragraph": 2,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "  NAD+ 是能量转移与细胞氧化还原反应中不可或缺的辅酶系统；多肽围绕细胞信号传导与免疫微环境进行系统修复。",
          "left": 914400,
          "top": 1828800,
          "width": 10362895,
          "height": 4389120,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 4,
          "paragraph": 3,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "• 科学审慎求证（拒绝概念绑架）：",
          "left": 914400,
          "top": 1828800,
          "width": 10362895,
          "height": 4389120,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 4,
          "paragraph": 4,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "  2026年系统综述明确指出：口服 NR/NMN 可较一致提升 NAD+ 生物标志物；但对血管、功能性结局的影响目前仍不稳定。尚无大规模结局试验证实静脉或肌肉注射 NAD+ 本身可以直接用于抗衰。",
          "left": 914400,
          "top": 1828800,
          "width": 10362895,
          "height": 4389120,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 4,
          "paragraph": 5,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "• 真实的临床干预共识：",
          "left": 914400,
          "top": 1828800,
          "width": 10362895,
          "height": 4389120,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 4,
          "paragraph": 6,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "  不追求玄学神迹。其根本目标是配合整体方案：改善线粒体底物供应、支持骨肌合成、对抗疲劳，在尿酸与肾功能全程可测的底线下，步步为营提高系统稳定性。",
          "left": 914400,
          "top": 1828800,
          "width": 10362895,
          "height": 4389120,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        }
      ],
      "charts": [],
      "images": [],
      "tables": []
    },
