          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 9,
          "paragraph": 1,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "• 彻底抛弃盲目爬山、无节制走路的传统误区",
          "left": 6492240,
          "top": 2468880,
          "width": 4663440,
          "height": 3383280,
          "font_size_pt": null,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false
        },
        {
          "shape_id": 9,
          "paragraph": 2,
          "run": 0,
          "text": "• 在连续血糖监测（CGM）的雷达实时护航下展开训练",
          "left": 6492240,
          "top": 2468880,
          "width": 4663440,
